          <span>Khao Sok Park Cave Hike</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We all hopped in the truck to head off to Khao Sok National Park. There, we would be hiking through dense rainforest on the way to a little-known Khao Sok cave called Bang Man, or Bang Hman, cave. The staff at Khao Sok Riverside Cottages had arranged the trip. Although most resorts here can arrange hikes, Riverside Cottages is one of the few that sends people to this part of the rainforest. Even though we had some great fried rice wrapped in banana leaves, we stopped to grab some water and snacks. It’s always good to have extra snacks! The [...]
        </p>
